{"title": "Salts of Cloud Giant Fingernails", "pageid": 26779, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Salts_of_Cloud_Giant_Fingernails", "categories": ["Alchemical extracts", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Extract_Green_Salts_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Extract_Green_Salts_Icon.png/300px-Extract_Green_Salts_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b5/Extract_Green_Salts_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Salts of Cloud Giant Fingernails image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Extract_Green_Salts_Icon.png/300px-Extract_Green_Salts_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Extract_Green_Salts_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Salts of Cloud Giant Fingernails</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemical Extraction</a>. It can be combined with any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Suspension</a> to create <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength\" title=\"Elixir of Cloud Giant Strength\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/ELX_Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Cloud_Giant_Strength\" title=\"Elixir of Cloud Giant Strength\">Elixir of Cloud Giant Strength</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Despotic, artistic, and terribly powerful, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Cloud_giant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"cloud giants\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" w